so be considered, but the degree must be conferred by 08/01/2027. Candidates should demonstrate the potential for excellent teaching, research, and service to the university and profession. Preferred Qualifications: Teaching/research interest in retailing, social media marketing, and/or advertising. Teaching experience, including online/hybrid modalities. Professional experience and/or certifications. Apply Now Job Info Job Identification 25933 Posting Date 08/12/2026, 02:59 PM Grade 0 Screening Date: 10/12/2026 © MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors Legend Jobs at a location Group of locations © MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors | © Oracle Corporation Terms Legal Notices Use command and scroll to zoom the map Use two fingers to move the map 242 E. 10th Street, Cookeville, TN, 38505, US Copy to Clipboard Similar Jobs Assistant Professor Cookeville, TN, United States Posted on 09/15/2026 Be the First to Apply Assistant Professor of Violin/Viola\n\nTennessee Tech is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer. Assistant Professor Cookeville, TN, United States Posted on 09/21/2026 The Department of Decision Sciences and Management at Tennessee Tech University invites applications for a full-time tenure-track Assistant Professor position beginning August 1, 2027. \n\nTennessee Tech is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer. Assistant Professor Cookeville, TN, United States and 1 more Posted on 09/11/2026 Be the First to Apply Teach courses, perform research, and fulfill service mission for the Department of Counseling and Psychology.\n\nTennessee Tech is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer. Assistant Professor of Clarinet Cookeville, TN, United States Posted on 09/21/2026 Be the First to Apply The School of Music at Tennessee Tech University invites applications for a tenure-track Assistant Professor of Clarinet, beginning August 1, 2027.\n\nTennessee Tech is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer. See More Jobs Tennessee Tech 